{"id":"66196e35b6208ba5","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness.md","title":"ZFC CI Pseudointersection Number Witness","display":"df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness — ZFC CI Pseudointersection Number Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness — ZFC CI Pseudointersection Number Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-intersection]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-pseudointersection-number-witness — ZFC CI Pseudointersection Number Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiPseudointersectionNumberWitness}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiPseudointersectionNumberWitness}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}pseudointersection\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiPseudointersectionNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\Bigl(\\forall G\\in[\\mathcal{F}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;|\\bigcap G|=\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}pseudointersection\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiPseudointersectionNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\Bigl(\\forall G\\in[\\mathcal{F}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;|\\bigcap G|=\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family has the strong finite-intersection property but admits no infinite pseudointersection.</li>\n<li>Almost inclusion is expanded as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\\)</span>, rather than being tied to the unrelated model-theoretic witness predicate.</li>\n<li>Parentheses now separate the finite-intersection clause from the global nonexistence clause, making the quantifier scope explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",